OL,3,GNEWSAKey dates and times for Yorkshire
OL,4,AChristmas markets
OL,5,
OL,6,FOne of Yorkshire's biggest Christmas
OL,7,Fmarkets opens later, selling food,
OL,8,Fdrink and handmade gifts.
OL,10,FMarkets in York and Sheffield opened
OL,11,Flast week, and the festivities in Leeds
OL,12,Fofficially get under way this evening.
OL,14,FAs well as the three biggest markets,
OL,15,Fmany others are also held around the
OL,16,Fregion, from Scarborough to Skipton,
OL,17,FHarrogate to Halifax and Barnsley to
OL,18,FBradford.
OL,20,FWe take a look at where some of the
OL,21,Fmarkets are set to be held and what
OL,22,Fthey will offer.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
